  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waste Water and Solid Waste Mopti, Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at developing a comprehensive and sustainable system for wastewater treatment and solid waste management in the municipality of Mopti, up to the horizon 2030. The preparatory studies also take into account the needs for strengthening the capacities of all actors involved in the collection and treatment of wastewater and waste. The studies will also analyse opportunities to strengthen or develop municipal infrastructure that could significantly contribute to the economic development of the city, with a focus on employment and income generating activities.</narrative>
  </description>
